  userData: '{"key": "GreenSummonWarBannerAura", "label": "GreenSummon \u72ec\u7acb\u6218\u65d7\u5149\u73af", "owner": "GreenSummon", "loop": true, "fps": 12, "duration": 0, "sort": 2, "action": "Effect: WAR BANNER AURA ONLY, 16-frame seamless loop. A low horizontal elliptical jade-green and gold celestial aura ring, seen in the same three-quarter game perspective, with subtle cloud-scroll energy curling upward a short distance and tiny gold/jade motes. No physical banner, pole, cloth, character or ground texture. F1-5 slow luminous swell and clockwise mote drift; F6-10 cloud-curls roll gently around the ring; F11-15 settle/fade back; F16 matchesF1. Stable ellipse footprint and center, complete ellipse entirely visible every frame. This is a separate under-foot/world-ground buff aura visual, not an opaque magic disc."}'
